issue_context.body:
https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/7ab754d9973e7b7481658bd937e186362f603f70/subsys/bluetooth/mesh/transport.c#L400-L414

In `seg_tx_send_unacked` func, if the first `segment `unable send, this function will be terminated and not set any `retransmit` timer, this will be occupy `seg_tx` object **forever**.


### Suggestion:

in end `seg_tx_send_unacked`

``` C
	tx->sending = 0U;
	tx->seg_o = 0U;
	tx->attempts--;
	
end:
	/* no one segment has been sending
	 * we mast set retransmit timer to again.
	 */
	if (!tx->seg_pending)
	{
		k_delayed_work_submit(&tx->retransmit, SEG_RETRY_TIMEOUT(tx));
	}

```

